      "description": {
        "es": "Sin descripción disponible.",
        "en": "Whenever a move makes contact with this Pokémon, the move's user has a 30% chance of being paralyzed, poisoned, or put to sleep, chosen at random.\n\nNothing is done to compensate if the move's user is immune to one of these ailments; there is simply a lower chance that the move's user will be affected."
